{"id":"a57cead6abc35383","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md","title":"正归纳支持一致性证明的条件","display":"thm-positive-induction-adequacy — 正归纳支持一致性证明的条件","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy","aliases":["91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy","91-thm-positive-induction","91-thm-KF-induction"],"display":"thm-positive-induction-adequacy — 正归纳支持一致性证明的条件","depends_on":["[[91-df-positive-formula]]","[[91-df-internal-induction]]","[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy</span><span>91-thm-positive-induction</span><span>91-thm-KF-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-positive-induction-adequacy — 正归纳支持一致性证明的条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" href=\"?note=e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" title=\"91-df-positive-formula\">91-df-positive-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"594ebea503d1a5bb\" href=\"?note=594ebea503d1a5bb\" title=\"91-df-internal-induction\">91-df-internal-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> (带正公式归纳的指定 KF 版本)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (PA 证明保持真的全局反思结论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> (固定矛盾句)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\)</span> (算术句编码谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (PA 一致性句)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}positive\\text{-}induction\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\operatorname{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\\\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\\\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}positive\\text{-}induction\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\operatorname{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\\\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\\\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一旦正归纳足以在所选公理化中对 PA 证明长度建立真理反思，矛盾不真就\n排除 PA 的矛盾证明。这里明确把真正需要验证的反思前提写入 Assertion。</p>\n<p>不同文献中的 “KF 加正归纳” 可能使用不同正公式语法、内部否定与基础\n归纳。不能仅凭“正”字就断言它是证明\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 的最小必要框架，更不能据此声称全\n真理归纳有不一致风险；这些强度与一致性结论需针对具体版本证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-positive-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-positive-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-internal-induction","status":"resolved","id":"594ebea503d1a5bb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-internal-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}positive\\text{-}induction\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\operatorname{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\\\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\\\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":1740,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistenc